  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"96a4b941-e99e-4705-89c4-3d1c505f9c27\">\n  <p class=\"poem\">Lord, make me an instrument of thy peace<br>\n<em>Where there is hatred...let me show love<br>\nWhere there is injury...pardon<br>\nWhere there is doubt...faith<br>\nWhere there is dispair...hope<br>\nWhere there is darkness...light<br>\nWhere there is sadness...joy</em></p>\n  <p class=\"poem\">O Master, grant that I may not so much seek<br>\n<em>To be consoled...as to console<br>\nTo be understood...as to understand<br>\nTo be loved...as to love<br>\nFor it is in giving...that we receive<br>\nIt is in pardoning...that we are pardoned<br>\nAnd it is in dying...that we are born to eternal life</em></p>\n  <p><em>Francis of Assisi</em></p>\n</article>\n",
